    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Venture out in this simple RPG!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your childhood friend, a female priest, has been jinxed by a curse! The clues to treatment lie in the ancient ruins and, being a knight of the Imperial Church\u2019s ruins research unit, you and your female friend must conquer this dungeon! And during your travels, a rather peculiar witch will also join your party... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple, easy-to-understand system! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An approachable 2D map system that will aid your dungeon conquest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adorable, peppy dialogue. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic, front-view battles that encourage seeking out enemy weaknesses to inflict maximum damage.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Venture out in this simple RPG!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your childhood friend, a female priest, has been jinxed by a curse! The clues to treatment lie in the ancient ruins and, being a knight of the Imperial Church\u2019s ruins research unit, you and your female friend must conquer this dungeon! And during your travels, a rather peculiar witch will also join your party... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple, easy-to-understand system! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An approachable 2D map system that will aid your dungeon conquest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adorable, peppy dialogue. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic, front-view battles that encourage seeking out enemy weaknesses to inflict maximum damage.</p></li></ul>",
